return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Ó di package WordPress site yìí — àwọn fáilì àti dátábàsì — sínú àkọsílẹ̀ kan tí Zinn Digital® lè fà wọlé, fún àwọn host tí a kò lè dé taàràtà lọ́nà mìíràn. Fi í sori wẹ́bù sáìtì tí o ń fi sílẹ̀, tẹ bọ́tìnnì kan, kí o sì lẹ ìjápọ̀ náà mọ́ ìnàjú Zinn® rẹ.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Gbe aaye yii lọ si Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Ko si si Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'O ko ní àṣẹ láti ṣe èyí.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Èyí dì gbogbo ohun tó wà lórí ojú-wọ̀ṣọ̀ yìí pọ̀ — àwọn fáìlì rẹ̀ àti ibùdó dátà rẹ̀ — sínú àkọsílẹ̀ kan, ó sì fún ọ ní àsopọ̀ ìkọ̀kọ̀ sí i. Fi àsopọ̀ yẹn lẹ́mọ́ sínú ìṣípò rẹ lórí Zinn® a sì máa fa ojú-wọ̀ṣọ̀ náà kọjá. Kò sí ohun tí a rán lọ sí ibikíbi níhìn-ín títí di ìgbà tí o bá yan láti pín àsopọ̀ náà.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'O le má fẹ́ èyí. Bí aṣojú wẹ́busáìti rẹ àtijọ́ bá fún ọ ní FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk tàbí DirectAdmin, Zinn® lè gba wẹ́busáìti náà tààrà pẹ̀lu àwọn àlàyé wọ̀nyí o sì lè fò plọ́gìn yìí sílẹ̀ pátápátá — ó yára jù, kò sì sí ohun tí yóò kù sílẹ̀ lẹ́yìn náà. Lo èyí nígbà tí èyíkéyìí nínú àwọn wọ̀nyí kò bá wà fún ọ.','Room on this server'=>'Ààyè lórí séfà yìí','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Sẹ́fà nì kò sọ iye ààyè disk tó wà fún wa, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò fún ọ. Àpò náà nílò ìwọ̀n %s sí i. Bí o kò bá ní ìdánilójú pé ààyè tó bẹ́ẹ̀ wà, bi olùgbàlejò rẹ kí o tó kọ́ ọ — sẹ́fà tó bá ní ààyè tó kọjá láàárín yóò mú ojú òpó náà kalẹ̀.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Àpò náà nílò bíi %1$s, ó sì jẹ́ pé sẹ̀fà náà ní %2$s tí kò sí nǹkan kan lọ́wọ́.','Build the package'=>'Kọ àpò náà','Building…'=>'Ń kọ́ ẹ̀rọ...','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Nísinsìnyìí ń kó di pọ̀: %1$s. %2$s àwọn fáìlì títí di báyìí, %3$s ti kọ.','your files'=>'awọn faili rẹ','your database'=>'data base rẹ','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','Cancel and delete'=>'Fa agbelebu si ki o si pa a rẹ́','Your package is ready'=>'Àpò rẹ ti ṣetan','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Da ọna asopọ yii ki o si lẹ mọọ sinu iṣipopada rẹ lori Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Iwọn: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Tọ́ sí àjápọ̀ yìí gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà. Ẹnikẹ́ni tí ó bá ní í le gba gbogbo ojú òpó wẹ́bù rẹ̀ sílẹ̀, pẹ̀lú àpò ìpìlẹ̀ ìponni rẹ̀. A máa ń pa àpò náà rẹ fúnrarẹ̀ wákàtí mẹ́rìndínlógún lẹ́yìn tí a dá a — pa a rẹ fúnrarẹ̀ ní kete tí ìṣíkiri rẹ̀ bá parí.','Delete the package now'=>'Pa akọṣẹ silẹ ni bayi','Build it again'=>'Kọ ọ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Server yii ko ni ẹ̀yọ̀ ZipArchive ti PHP, nitorinaa a ko le kọ apoti kan si ibi. Bere lọwọ olupese rẹ lati jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ, tabi lo fọọmu ìṣípòpadà lori Zinn® pẹlu awọn alaye FTP tabi SSH rẹ dipo.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'A ko le ṣẹda folda kan ninu iṣẹ abuja rẹ, nitorina ko si ibi lati kọ package naa. Ṣayẹwo pe wp-content/uploads jẹ alagbeka fun kikọ.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Kò sí àpò tí a ń kọ́ lọ́wọ́. Bẹ̀rẹ̀ ọ̀kan níṣájú.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'A kò lè ṣí fáìlì àpò náà fún kíkọ.','We could not write the database export.'=>'A ko le kọ igbejade ibi ipamọ data naa.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ni àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọni olùṣe','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka ìtọ́nisọ́ ti olùṣe %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gbale Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfmọ̀ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ju ojú òpó wẹ́bù kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn aye ọna asopọ ti o ti fi idi mulẹ, pẹlu owo ti o wa ni ipamọ lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni idunnu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba awọn eniyan ti eyi jẹ iṣẹ wọn siṣẹ','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọja iṣẹ́ aládàáni káríayé wa: ṣe àwárí ju 10,000 àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹrẹ, àwọn olùgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn amoye SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fúnni ní owó.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbàlàwọ́n tí a ṣe sílẹ̀ náà kùnà àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi í sí i.']];